+<section class="faq" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div class="section-head"><h2 id="faq-title">A few good questions</h2><p>Still wondering? <a href="mailto:hello@relay.chat">Ask us anything.</a></p></div><details><summary>Can I change plans later?</summary><p>Anytime. Upgrade or downgrade from your workspace settings, and we’ll make sure billing adjusts fairly.</p></details><details><summary>What does yearly billing mean?</summary><p>Yearly plans are paid once a year, at 20% less than paying month to month. The price shown is the per-user monthly equivalent.</p></details><details><summary>Can I try Relay before paying?</summary><p>Yes. The Free plan is free forever, and you can explore the core Relay experience with your team before upgrading.</p></details><details><summary>What happens if my team grows?</summary><p>Just add teammates when you need them. Team and Business pricing is per active user, so your plan can grow with you.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer help moving our team?</summary><p>We’re happy to help you get set up. Get in touch at <a href="mailto:hello@relay.chat">hello@relay.chat</a> and we’ll take it from there.</p></details></section>
